1 NOTE Mother of Hengky. Liam confirmed (18 Nov 2026) that her Chinese name was Tjoa Hong Tjoei, matching the Social Security index. Her 1932 birth should be in the Padang Chinese civil birth register 1927-1940 (Kantor Catatan Sipil Padang; FamilySearch film 1474366, DGS 9161345, 3,079 images). The images are restricted to FamilySearch Centers and affiliate libraries; the register is not name-indexed. Born in Padang, the family's hometown; lived in Norfolk County, MA; people-search sites list her at the same Quincy address as Hengky and Iskandar Gunawan. Sources: Social Security NUMIDENT (FamilySearch ark 1:1:6KM3-29Q1), parents "Eng K Ang" and "Ke K Tjoa"; SSDI (ark 1:1:J5F2-GYH), d. 18 Jul 2004, Norfolk Co. Name variants "Hong Tjoei Tjoa" / "Hong Tjheei Tjea" from a Social Security claims-index summary (sortedbyname.com), which suggests a maiden name of Tjoa. Needs confirmation from Hengky.
