1 MARR
2 DATE 30 OCT 1915
2 PLAC Panteleimon Church, St. Petersburg, Russian Empire
2 NOTE Married Anna Vladimirovna Udyanovskaya. Metric book, TsGIA SPb f.19 op.127 d.3148 l.234 (cited by Rodovid). VGD index of St. Petersburg metric books: groom "court councillor (n.s.) Georgij Vladimirovich", bride "Udyanovskaya, daughter of a provincial secretary, Anna Vladimirovna", Panteleimon church, 30 Oct 1915. First marriage, 27 Jan 1913 (church listed as "Skorb. Latysh.", TsGIA SPb 19-127-2810 l.7): Georgij, then a titular councillor, married his first cousin Olga Konstantinovna Nemirovich-Danchenko (b. 1890), daughter of Col. (later Maj.-Gen.) Konstantin Prokofievich. Georgij's own baptism record is in TsGIA SPb 19-125-1063 l.748 (church of the Engineers' Castle, 1889; father a captain). Rodovid lists a son, Georgij Georgievich, born 21 Sep 1916 in St. Petersburg ("alternative date 1922"); this may be a conflation with George (b. Munich, 6 Oct 1921) or an earlier son. Brother: Vasily Vladimirovich (4 Mar 1887 - 22 Sep 1970), married Olga Iosifovna Doboshinskaya in Gatchina.
